{
  "$comment": "Logs-to-metrics per source (spec 01 §8.3, spec 08 §7.4), defined before the first deploy. A metric with no aggregations is a label (type string_low_cardinality). Each sql_expression is rendered as JSONExtract(raw, '<field>', 'Nullable(<String|Float64>)'). No ID is ever a label (MC-06).",
